    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "FY2025 10-K把 Google Cloud 收入来源披露为三类：Google Cloud Platform、Google Workspace 和 other enterprise services；其中 Cloud Platform 以“consumption-based fees and subscriptions”为主，Workspace 为订阅，另有其他企业服务。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000451-6ce30e96",
            "quote": "Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000452-43035749",
            "quote": "Google Workspace includes subscriptions"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000453-9711d965",
            "quote": "other enterprise services"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "2026 Q2 10-Q 的披露在保留前两类的同时，新增了“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems”这一收入来源；因此，Q2 10-Q 对 Google Cloud 收入构成的明示来源比 FY2025 10-K 更细了一层。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000531-fa802653",
            "quote": "Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"
          },
          {
